    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perk Up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Multiplayer Deck-Building Fighting Game Where Death Makes You Stronger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game:</strong><br>Perk Up! is a fast-paced <strong>multiplayer fighting game</strong> with a unique twist\u2014<strong>dying isn\u2019t the end, it\u2019s just the beginning!</strong> In this brutal arena, every elimination makes you stronger, pushing you closer to becoming the ultimate warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-Building Combat:</strong> Choose from an insane <strong>31,569,011,603,496,215,106,480</strong> build possibilities! Start with nothing but your weapon, and with each elimination, pick new perks, power-ups, and abilities to evolve into the ultimate fighter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die to Grow Stronger:</strong> Every time you're eliminated, you gain new abilities and power-ups\u2014turning death into your greatest advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last One Standing:</strong> Battle against other players, outsmart your enemies, and survive until you're the <strong>strongest warrior left.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Fight!</strong><br>Are you ready to embrace the chaos, build the ultimate loadout, and prove you\u2019re the best? <strong>Join the fight now!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perk Up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Multiplayer Deck-Building Fighting Game Where Death Makes You Stronger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game:</strong><br>Perk Up! is a fast-paced <strong>multiplayer fighting game</strong> with a unique twist\u2014<strong>dying isn\u2019t the end, it\u2019s just the beginning!</strong> In this brutal arena, every elimination makes you stronger, pushing you closer to becoming the ultimate warrior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck-Building Combat:</strong> Choose from an insane <strong>31,569,011,603,496,215,106,480</strong> build possibilities! Start with nothing but your weapon, and with each elimination, pick new perks, power-ups, and abilities to evolve into the ultimate fighter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die to Grow Stronger:</strong> Every time you're eliminated, you gain new abilities and power-ups\u2014turning death into your greatest advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last One Standing:</strong> Battle against other players, outsmart your enemies, and survive until you're the <strong>strongest warrior left.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Fight!</strong><br>Are you ready to embrace the chaos, build the ultimate loadout, and prove you\u2019re the best? <strong>Join the fight now!</strong></p>",
